"Port Augusta へ":"To Port Augusta","高原から海辺の町へ下るアップダウンの道。上り坂では電池が減り、下り坂では回生ブレーキで取り戻せるよ。町に入ったら制限速度に注意。":"A hilly road down from the plateau to a seaside town. Climbs drain the battery; on descents regen braking wins it back. Watch the limit in town.","Port Augusta はスペンサー湾のいちばん奥にある町で『アウトバックの入口』と呼ばれます。東には Flinders 山脈。ここから南は畑と海の景色に変わり、ゴールの Adelaide まであと約 300 km です。":"Port Augusta sits at the head of Spencer Gulf and is called the “gateway to the outback”. The Flinders Ranges lie to the east. South of here it turns to farmland and sea, about 300 km from the finish in Adelaide.",
"車検: 8 の字":"Scrutineering: figure 8","内円半径 6 m の 8 の字を、コースからはみ出さずに走ろう。片側 9 秒・合計 18 秒未満で合格。":"Drive a figure 8 with a 6 m inner radius without leaving the course. Under 9 s per side and 18 s total to pass.","本番の車検でも 8 の字走行があります。ソーラーカーは車体が長く、小回りが苦手。ハンドルを早めに切るのがコツ。":"The real scrutineering includes a figure 8. Solar cars are long and don't turn tightly — steer early.",
